# Portfolio V11 progressive loads (mandatory)

Do **not** load the entire portfolio API surface on every page. Paint the page’s main data first; load extras in the background only if that page uses them.

## Rules

1. **Page-scoped fetches** — use `scopesForPage(page)` + `loadPortfolioV11Scopes(scopes)` in `lib/portfolio-v11/bootstrap.ts`. Never reintroduce a single “load everything” cold path for normal navigation.
2. **Primary → paint → secondary** — host loads each `primary` scope **one at a time**, hydrating after each; then fires `secondary` scopes independently (non-blocking).
3. **Merge hydrate** — omit unused keys from `payload.data` so `replaceCollection` leaves other collections alone. Soft navigations must not call `beginLiveLoad` (that clears all collections).
4. **New pages** — update `scopesForPage` + `primaryLoadLabel` with the minimum primary API; put filters/side panels in `secondary`.

## Page → scopes (source of truth: `scopesForPage`)

| Page | Primary (paint) | Secondary (background) |
|------|-----------------|------------------------|
| Deal Flow / deal detail | `applications` | `funds` |
| Dashboard | `dashboard` | `companies`, `funds`, `applications` |
| Funds / fund detail / fund performance | `funds` | `dashboard` |
| Capital calls | `capitalCalls` (+ funds dependency) | — |
| Companies | `companies` | `funds` |
| LPs | `lps` | — |
| Cash accounts / overview | `cashAccounts` | `funds` |
| Cash ledger | `cashLedger` | `cashAccounts` |
| Reservations | `cashReservations` | `cashAccounts` |
| Statement imports | `statementImports` | — |
| Reconciliations | `recon` | `cashAccounts` |
| Exceptions | `exceptions` | — |
| Period close | `periodClose` | — |
| Reporting / reports vault | `reporting` (+ funds dependency) | — |
| Documents | `documents` | — |
| E-signatures | `agreements` | — |
| Mailer lists | `mailer` (+ funds dependency) | — |
| Settings | `settings` | — |
| Analytics | `dashboard` | `funds` |

## Anti-patterns

```text
❌ Promise.all([applications, capitalCalls, cash, recon, …]) on any single page
❌ beginLiveLoad on every sidebar navigation
❌ Waiting for secondary scopes before first paint
❌ Bundling unrelated scopes into primary “just in case”
✅ applications → hydrate deals → background funds for filters
✅ dashboard → hydrate metrics → background companies/funds/deals
```
